+/// V_SCREEN: `|P| <= 2.022_827 * max|x|` for every Annex-2 phase (the table's largest per-phase L1
+/// norm), so taps all below `0.49 * limit` give `fl(P) < 0.9915 * limit` even after the twelve
+/// roundings, and `|h[6]| < limit` too: the peak cannot exceed the limit and `r` is exactly 1.0.
+const SCREEN_FACTOR: f32 = 0.49;
